  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Each friendly **ORKS PSYKER** unit may use **psychic abilities** in a [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) whose total **psychic level** is at most its own **psyker level**. The unit's abilities give its **psyker level**, and each ability's name gives its **psychic level**. For example, a level 3 unit could use:\n\n- 3 level 1 abilities\n- 1 level 1 and 1 level 2 ability\n- 1 level 3 ability",
